==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Charmander}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Hidden Fates|Charmander|7}} from the {{TCG|Hidden Fates}} expansion.
*'''Combustion''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Destiny|Slugma|82}} from the {{TCG|Neo Destiny}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

